  "source_policy": {
    "registration": "Default notification center; object and queue nil; separate buildStartedToken/buildCompletedToken stores. Forwarders bind start/stop callbacks.",
    "guard": "Notification.object conditional cast to IDEBuildOperation; operation.executionEnvironment.workspace compared with listener workspace using imported NSObject equality. Both absent passes; one absent or unequal rejects.",
    "start": "isPreviewsBuild imported getter returns buildCommand == 8. Low bit stored as payload with tag 3 and sent through SubscriberCollection.notifyAll.",
    "stop": "operation.result == 1 stored as payload with tag 4 and sent through the same subscriber forwarding entry. The semantic result enum name is not established.",
    "prior_handler_correlation": "Previously recovered event metadata names tags 3/4 buildSystemBuildStarted/buildSystemBuildStopped. Prior build-time-gate source assigns timestamp for both start flag values; preview-build true exits after timestamp, false invalidates builder/coalescer and optionally requests workspaceChanged then pauses userInitiatedBuild."
  },
